{"title":"잡용 부여술사가 자신의 강함을 눈치챌 때까지 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=LQ1Du/dJMb83ErZsE/pynufEWyxDMSBlIlOc3l6K&filename=th3","synopsis":"“부여술사”로서 철저한 서포트를 해주던\n비전투원 빔 슈트라우스는\n동료를 위기에서 구하기 위해 직접 나서서,\n단독으로 계층주를 쓰러뜨리는 것에 성공한다.\n그러나, 그는 공을 가로챘다며 격앙된\n리더 크로노스에 의해 파티에서 추방되고.\n갈 곳을 잃고 망연자실하던 빔은\n소꿉친구인 하이데마리에 의해 발견되어\n최대 규모의 A랭크 파티 「밤잠자리」의 권유를 받게 되는데….\n자신의 능력을 자각하지 못한 “잡용 부여술사”가\n진정한 힘을 깨닫고 말 때― 세계는 들썩이게 된다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":283,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":254,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-18","rank":267,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-27","rank":248,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-28","rank":252,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":1649,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":1649,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":1649,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":1649,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":1649,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":1653,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":1656,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":1674,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":1674,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":1674,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":1674,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":1675,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":1692,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":1692,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":1694,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":1694,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":1700,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":1736,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-29","v":1736,"rc":11,"rs":110,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-30","v":1736,"rc":11